@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 分片上传与合并 时序图（2025-11-17）

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/文件列表页\n(List.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as Ctrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as Svc
participant "系统设置服务\nSystemSettingService" as Setting
database "UserRepository" as UserRepo
database "FolderRepository" as FolderRepo
database "FileRepository" as FileRepo
participant "文件系统\n(FS)" as FS
participant "审计日志\nAuditLogService" as Audit

== 预处理/秒传 ==
User -> UI: 选择大文件
UI -> UI: 计算 SHA-256 (前端)
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/exists { fileHash }
Axios -> Ctrl: checkFileExists
Ctrl -> Svc: findByHashIfExists(userId, hash)
Svc -> FileRepo: 按 userId+hash 查询
alt 存在
  Ctrl --> Axios: { exists: true, ... }
  Axios --> UI: 直接完成（秒传）
  return
else 不存在
  Ctrl --> Axios: { exists: false }
end

== 分片上传 ==
loop for chunk = 1..N (并发<=3)
  UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/chunk\n{ file=part, fileHash, chunkNumber, totalChunks }
  Axios -> Ctrl: uploadChunk
  Ctrl -> Svc: saveChunk(userId, hash, partNo, total)
  Svc -> FS: 保存至 chunks/user_<id>/<hash>/chunk_<n>.part
  Svc --> Ctrl: 成功
  Ctrl --> Axios: 200 { message }
end

== 合并前核对缺片 ==
UI -> Axios: GET /api/files/chunk/status?fileHash&totalChunks
Axios -> Ctrl: chunkStatus
Ctrl -> Svc: listUploadedChunks(userId, hash)
Svc -> FS: 列举 chunk_*.part
Ctrl --> Axios: { uploaded, missing?, totalChunks? }
opt 存在 missing
  UI -> Axios: 逐个补传 missing 分片（与上同）
end

== 合并 ==
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/merge\n{ fileHash, filename, totalChunks, folderId? }
Axios -> Ctrl: mergeChunks
group 策略/配额
Ctrl -> Svc: mergeChunks(...)
Svc -> Setting: isUploadAllowAll()/getAllowedSuffixes()
alt 后缀拒绝
  Svc --> Ctrl: 400 { message }
  Ctrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 提示失败
  return
end
Svc -> FS: 计算各分片总大小
Svc -> UserRepo: tryUseQuota(userId, totalSize)
alt 空间不足
  Svc --> Ctrl: 400 { message }
  Ctrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 提示存储不足
  return
end
end
group 合并与落盘
Svc -> FS: ensureDir(storagePath/user_<id>)
Svc -> FS: 依序读取分片流式写入目标并累计哈希
Svc -> Svc: 校验目标哈希 == fileHash
alt 不一致
  Svc -> FS: 删除目标文件
  Svc --> Ctrl: 400 { message }
  Ctrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 提示失败（可稍后续传）
  return
end
Svc -> FolderRepo: findByIdAndUserIdAndDeletedFalse(folderId, userId)
Svc -> FileRepo: save(File记录)
Svc -> FS: 删除分片目录
Svc -> Audit: logSuccess(UPLOAD)
end

Ctrl --> Axios: 200 { fileId, filename, size, uploadTime }
Axios --> UI: 刷新列表并提示成功

@enduml

